  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ドラゴンボールZ』より悟天とトランクスがフュージョンし、超サイヤ人化した「超サイヤ人ゴテンクス」が登場！",
      "en": "From \"Dragon Ball Z \" comes the fusion of Goten and Trunks, \" Super Saiyan Gotenks\" who has become a Super Saiyan!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• Figure-rise Standardならではの、肉体や服を自然な造形と組み立てで再現。",
      "en": "• The body and clothes are reproduced with natural shapes and assemblies that are unique to Figure-rise Standard."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 充実のエフェクトパーツで独特な必殺技の再現ができる。",
      "en": "• You can reproduce unique special moves with a wide range of effect parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 表情パーツ２種のほか、かめはめ波（両手）、ピ－ス（左手のみ）、人差し（右手のみ）といったポーズを演出するハンドパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• In addition to two types of expression parts, hand parts are included to create poses such as Kamehameha (both hands), peace (left hand only), and pointing finger (right hand only)."
    }
  ],
